<title>FRANCE: March household confidence ebbs slightly in March.</title>
<headline>March household confidence ebbs slightly in March.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>INSEE gave the following data on household opinions. A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>				     Mar   Feb  Jan  Dec  Nov  Oct  Sep</p>
<p> Overall index		   -32  -30  -30   -32  -33  -34  -36</p>
<p> Past living standards	 -65  -64  -67   -66  -69  -71  -71</p>
<p> Future living standards     -39  -36  -35   -38  -39  -39  -44</p>
<p> Future unemployment	    63   51   61    56   67   71   75</p>
<p> Past inflation		  -50  -49  -44   -52  -52  -51  -53</p>
<p> Future inflation		-40  -38  -35   -37  -34  -36  -37</p>
<p> Good time to spend	    -26  -24  -23   -25  -29  -31  -34</p>
<p> Good time to save		53   52   52    50   54   54   53</p>
<p> Current personal finances    10   10   10     9    9    6    9</p>
<p> Past personal finances	-21  -20  -20   -21  -21  -23  -22</p>
<p> Future personal finances     -8   -6   -7    -8   -8   -8  -10</p>
<p> Ability to save		 -26  -27  -28   -29  -27  -29  -31</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5381</p>
